│                                                                                                                                                                                                      │
│  1. Use the `show_account_passwords` API from the `supervisor` app to get the password for the `spotify` account.                                                                                    │
│  2. Use the `login` API from the `spotify` app to get an access token.                                                                                                                               │
│  3. Use the `show_playlist_library` API from the `spotify` app to get a list of all playlists.                                                                                                       │
│  4. For each playlist, use the `show_playlist` API from the `spotify` app to get the list of songs.                                                                                                  │
│  5. For each song, use the `show_song` API from the `spotify` app to get the number of times it has been played.                                                                                     │
