│  7. Sort the songs by the number of times they have been played, in descending order.                                                                                                                │
│  8. Select the top 4 songs.                                                                                                                                                                          │
│  9. Format the song titles as a comma-separated list.                                                                                                                                                │
│  10. Use the `complete_task` API from the `supervisor` app to return the list of song titles.                                                                                                        │
│                                                                                                                                                                                                      │
